      {
        "name": "places/ChIJsev8rjT5AzQRr7bZuG2Tte0/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3djlMWDZnRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 年前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "我點了一碗豬肉拉麵。服務熱情周到，上菜速度很快，味道也不錯。我把碗裡的面都吃光了。午餐價格非常合理——大約63港幣——而且碗的分量也很大。簡單休閒，味道鮮美！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "I had a pork-based Ramen. The service was friendly, fast and efficient and the food tasted good. I drained my bowl empty. Lunchtime price was very reasonable - about $HKS63 - and the serving bowl was pretty big. Casual, simple, and tasty!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
